@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8081

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

### Create an item
# @name createItem
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Widget"
}

### List items
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/items

### Fetch the item created above
@itemId = {{createItem.response.body.$.id}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/items/{{itemId}}

### Fetch a missing item
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/items/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Create with an invalid name (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": ""
}
